militaries are allied to America.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T08:00:26-07:00","id":988249,"title":"","content":"Are you kidding? Obama is the anti-Reagan. Don't confuse capitalism with oligarchy/corporatocrazy. Reagan is Hayek and Obama is Keynes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0nERTFo-Sk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0nERTFo-Sk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0nERTFo-Sk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0nERTFo-Sk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTQnarzmTOc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTQnarzmTOc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTQnarzmTOc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTQnarzmTOc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The free market is the opposite to the oligopolies. Capitalism doesn't mean to be a rich businessman, but to manage your own business without asking favours and licking politician's boots. It isn't blessing opresion by corporations but be againts estatism because civil servants are worse managers (they aren't risking their own money, but from our taxes). <br /> <br /> Neoliberalism isn't Detroit (from Robocop's movies) being controlled OCP but to be againts a Detroit controled by OCP whose main CEOs are ex-politicians assigned due to political revolving doors. Do you get the idea, the message I am trying to send? Not all businessmen are the enemies, Bruce Wayne isn't like Lex Luthor, Tony Stark isn't like Norman Osborn. Bourgeoisie, businessmen are like mutants with superpowers from comics or sepllcaster wizards from fantasy fiction, they see themself more powerful by their talents, training and effort, envidied and feared by the masses (sometimes by a good reason, but not alway). The estatists are like the crusaders and witch-hunters, they promises to procteck the people, but we have to obey their rules. Can you trust blindly who promise save you from more powerful ones? But what if the remedy is worse than illness, is your savior worse your previous boss?<br /> <br /> I see in the Western sides a lot of things I don't like (and I want to correct and improve them), but I don't think the right answer is a world where Russia and China face each other for the hegemony. Maybe we are in the beginning of the second cold war, and we could lose it. Are you going to allow all Oriental Europe being satellites dictatorships like Bielorrusia? Don't you think Russia will try to rule all Europe if it has got enough ways and NATO doesn't dare to face it? Do you think Fox Mulder and Dana Scally should help/ally Chinese and Russia agents againts the Cigarette Smoking Man's conspiration?<br /> <br /> Have you readen about Mexican Cristero war in the begining of the XX century? It could happen again in this century, and not only in Mexican land, but also in the own United States. We are talking about deaths of people from other countries you once met when played that Overwatch multiplayer game or wrote in that forum about movies, foreign people from far lands but you have met online sometime. I have got fear about my children, or greatchildren suffering a war like my grandparents'. Maybe we are following the same steps and making the same mistakes.<br /> <br /> I don't want a new world war, but USA needs to recover the detenrrence power. Sometimes the only possible diplomacy is &quot;si vix pacem, para bellum&quot; ( if you want peace get ready for war).<br /> <br /> * To be the police of the world is too sacrifice fo so much ingratitude (Who thanks Spain to have saved Western in the battle of Lepanto?) but now the world is worse because Barack Husseim Obama didn't want to be the right world cop. (Why Barack Obama had got a book &quot;the Post-American world&quot; by the journalist Fareed Zakaria? It sounds so supect as a Manchurian candidate).<br /> <br /> * True leadership means get and keep trust and loyalty by allies and subordinates, not with menaces as a toxic boss. If you need humilliate others to get respect, then you don't deserve this. <br /> <br /> <b>\u201cYou Were Given The Choice Between War And Dishonor. You Chose Dishonor And You Will Have War.\u201d</b><br /> <br /> Wiston Churchill to Neville Chamberlain, about 1938 Munich agreement. (I am afraid Obama is the new Chamberlain, trying to avoid war he causes it)<br /> <br /> <br /> * Please, I want to believe USA can still stop Russian and Chinese imperalism, but now it is hard to me. Barack Obama hasn't invested enough while Russia and China have spent lot of money to update their armies. (but expensive tosy aren't enough to win wars).<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>History teaches</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> that </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>war</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> begins when governments believe the </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>price</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> of aggression is cheap.&quot; Ronald Reagan.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>&quot;Wars</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> are </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>not caused</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> by the </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>buildup</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> of </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>weapons</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">. </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>They</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> are </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>caused</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> when an </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>aggressor believes he can achieve his</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> objectives at an acceptable price&quot;. by Margaret Tacher</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">&quot;When buying and selling are controlled by legislation, the </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>first</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> things to be bought and sold are legislators.&quot; - by </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>P. J. O'Rourke</b></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":11152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","user":"Luis Carlos","date":". 10-16-2016, 12:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T10:24:02-07:00","id":988300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988206#post988206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, now I am busy. A group of white walkers from beyond the wall of North Westeros have just arrived and Angela Merkel wants to allow them to enter here.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is insanely offensive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T10:53:26-07:00","id":988305,"title":"","content":"Don't you know lot of those &quot;refugees&quot; are not even Syirians or Iraqui but from other countries? They are called &quot;economic emigrants&quot;, unkonwn people who may be members of terrorist groups, or fugitives running away from the justice of other country. There are rumors about many Moroccan criminals aren't sent to prison, but they have got the option to mount on pateras (little wood boats) to cross the straight of Gibraltar toward Spain.<br /> <br /> This is not about &quot;all foreigners have to go away&quot; but &quot;if you are a good citizen you are wellcome, and even we can good friends, but if you cause troubles, then we will not want you to be here&quot;. It isn't &quot;all frontier doors to be closed&quot; but &quot;we need a filter, some rules to help who really needs us, and to say no to those false refugees who are stealing help for the true people in need&quot;. Have you readen about Christians refugees being harassed by Muslims in the own camps? Do you know anything about sexual harassament and attacks in Germany (the city of Cologne, for example), or the no-go zones in UK or France, and sharia patrols in some neighbours? Of course you can't know about my own city, where I live now, there was a brief confrotation between Blackafrican and Maghrebi inmigrants. Some people are afraid about a civil war in Europe because the European Parliament in Brussels has