quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T12:38:15-07:00","id":988338,"title":"","content":"Someone here's made a slur against African Americans and compared refugees to literally monsters, another has said mean things about Donald Trump. Spare me the &quot;both sides!&quot; talk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T13:08:43-07:00","id":988351,"title":"","content":"I'm just going to copy/paste something someone else wrote because it makes the point clearer than I could<br /> <br /> &quot;being president isn\u2019t a special award you get by being a wonderful person who\u2019s never done anything wrong. being president is a job two people are trying to be hired for. one of them is the endorsed candidate of literally actual nazis, and the KKK, and vladmir putin, and will gain access to nuclear weapons if appointed president. his running mate is very open about wanting to roll back rights for women to turn of the last century or earlier. he himself has failed at every single business venture he\u2019s managed and has been sued repeatedly for sexual assault. <a href=\"http://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/us-elections/donald-trump-rape-sexual-assault-claims-court-republican-party-us-presidential-florida-a7360636.html\" target=\"_blank\">he\u2019s being sued again this month for raping a thirteen year old.</a><br /> <br /> the other candidate is a successful politician, who\u2019s got a proven track record of voting very progressively for the times she\u2019s been in office, who openly regrets many of her earlier and more racist positions and statements, and who is working to make amends. she\u2019s lied significantly less than most of her peers. she listens to her constituency way more. she\u2019s almost exactly as progressive as bernie sanders, and has gotten a lot more done than him too, while being a woman under constant investigation for corruption and wrong-doing, neither of which was ever found.<br /> <br /> if they\u2019re both awful, clinton is awful like a stubbed toe and trump is awful like disembowelment. and one of them is going to be president. suck it the fuck up.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:45:06-07:00","id":988416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988243#post988243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm personally supporting the Democrats because I enjoy having the right to marry and I'd like to add the right to be employed to that list. That'd be <i>swell</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The Republican platform this election is kind of a tire fire, to be honest. It tacitly supports conversion therapy, which is an unholy and unforgivable blight upon this world. Oh and it states that republican senators will continue to refuse to do their job by not appointing a supreme court justice, which is nice.<br /> <br /> They also want to privatize Social Security- because exposing our retired elders to market forces is the <i>best </i>possible way to ensure they get the money they deserve! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I could go on all day, but to put it shortly: To me, most of the Republican positions fall somewhere between misguided and abominable.<br /> <br /> The alternatives aren't much better to be honest. The Green Party is absorbing the left's crazy anti-science groups; generally desperately scraping for votes. Oh and Libertarians. Their policies seem out-right neglectful to me.<br /> <br /> I mean, Johnson thinks the best way to help poor kids go to college is to remove federally backed loans, based on the belief that the magic of market forces will lower the price of college to a manageable level; not (as college education is basically required for any non-service job) just result in tons of people suddenly being forced away from higher-paying jobs. Supporting a poor-stay-poor ethic doesn't quite seem like a good idea, but other people may have different opinions.<br /> <br /> Indeed, the way Libertarians seem to want to run government, I'd expect a the poverty rate to sky-rocket while the suddenly laissez faire federal government allows half the nation to reverse decades of social progress.<br /> <br /> I mean, I know the only think keeping my sexuality from being outright illegal is probably the threat of the Feds hanging above the collective heads of my state like the fist of an angry god.<br /> <br /> So I'm voting Democrat because they're the non-crazy alternative to <i>seceding away </i>my basic human rights. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> Libertarians are for partying with, not voting for <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm glad the Greens are taking all the antiscience groups, I hope they take ALL the antiscience groups.<br /> <br /> That way more useful leftwing parties will be free of them. Hope that happens in Canada too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T14:58:08-07:00","id":988426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988305#post988305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It isn't &quot;all frontier doors to be closed&quot; but &quot;we need a filter, some rules to help who really needs us, and to say no to those false refugees who are stealing help for the true people in need&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry but this is a US politics thread. And some people here are very much calling for &quot;all frontier doors to be closed.&quot;<br /> <br /> And despite the Trump campaign lying to people and saying we don't, we <b>absolutely do</b> have the filters that you're talking about. So there's no excuse for the fear mongering in the US about bad apples in the refugees we would allow in.<br /> <br /> If bad apples are getting into Europe because European governments aren't as rigorous in checking refugees as US policy already demands, that's all the more reason for the US to take more of the refugee burden off of Europe by approving a larger number of refugee relocations and then starting our long vetting process rather than dragging our heels while our allies struggle with balancing the safety of their citizens with their own laws regarding refugee screening.<br /> <br /> It's a reason to get back to work with NATO and improving intelligence sharing between member nations so there's better communication between nations about suspect individuals, rather than pissing off our NATO allies by caring more about posturing and bravado than policy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Why not to help them in the Turkish refugee camps to avoid they risk their lifes crossing sea toward Greece? </div> </div> </div>Turkey is in no position to handle the refugee crisis by itself. Also, you might recall that Turkey just had to put down a military coup attempt. It might be more stable than Syria... but that's not saying that much. Turkey has spent almost its how history since the fall of the Ottoman Empire in a state of violent civil unrest as both majority factions attempting coups by force and minorities resorting to violence for equal treatment has continually been a problem for the country.<br /> <br /> Adding more refugees to their land is not a good recipe since they barely hold together as it is.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Why countries from Arabian peninsule haven't admited refugees like Egypt and other Muslims countries did? </div> </div> </div>Most of them are tiny, the majority of the people there are poor and suffering major unemployment issues, and a good number of them have their own humanitarian crisis conflicts going on. You want to send them to Saudi Arabia or Yemen (currently in conflict with each other)? To the UAE where the government turns a blind eye to immigrant workers becoming forced labor? To Israel/Palestine to add to that mess? Iraq?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This man isn't only a simpathyzer of radical Muslim groups,... </div> </div> </div>As has been discussed (at least in the US by people that actually study this stuff) to death, this is a self-fulfilling prophecy. The radicals tell people how the West hates Muslims and that they're fighting to protect Muslims from Western persecutions. The refugees don't believe it because the West seems like a pretty good place and the radicals seem like horrible people. The refugees make it to the West and find out that the West don't really want them, or like them. Then they start to wonder if the radicals were right all along...<br /> <br /> See, that's one of the things people forget. Stopping Islamophobia and even being more respectful to the refugees than their actions might normally deserve? It's not just some moral position. It's also a weapon against the radicals. We need to be the better people to show that the radicals are wrong, and have always been wrong, about us, because that's how we beat them. In a war for hearts and minds, you don't win by being the nasty guy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If I don't feel being respected, then I don't see the duty to respect the rest of people, when I am offended, I consider me to have got the same right to offend anothers (to defense my proud). </div> </div> </div>So... eye for an eye instead of turning the other cheek?<br /> <br /> Though I'll admit I actually hate the &quot;eye for an eye&quot; idiom as it is completely out of context.<br /> <br /> More directly though, you have kind of long since burnt up sympathy for your social skills, or the language barrier. You don't stop saying offensive things when called out on it. You keep saying them. That's not you getting disrespected, that's you being called out for being disrespectful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T15:04:31-07:00","id":988429,"title":"","content":"Okay, fuck this. I don't think a single thing of worth has been said in this entire thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T01:23:01-07:00","id":988734,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I didn't mean everybody from beyond wall of North Westeros are &quot;white walkers&quot;, but although we have to help and be supportive with all those innocent people who are running away from a zombie apocalipse, we must take care because among newcomers there are &quot;infected&quot; and &quot;spies&quot; with bad intentions. We can't help if our enemies sabotage our resources in our own land. We need to separate wheat and chaff, helping who need us, but stopping hostile groups. <br /> <br /> And don't forget the democrate party wants to bring refugees from Syria (and then you will suffer the same fate than Europe).<br /> <br /> I am Spanish, I live in a land of emigrants and inmigrants, and when I read about the aliens crossing Mexican frontier, I dare to say I can understand this matter both points of view. Maybe I am ignorant of a lot of things about Norhtamerica... (I thought Alaska was all ice until the serie &quot;Doctor in Alaska&quot; was broadcaster here), but also from here I can see somethings unkonwn for you, and my opinion may enrich this debate<br /> <br /> Here in Spain we have got a lot of proberbs, sayings, and one of them is &quot;when you see your neiughbour's beard dry up, leave yours to soak&quot;. (= pay atention about what happens around because it may also affect you)<br /> <br /> <br /> Be careful, USA is losing the propaganda war, and I can say it because precisely my point of view is very subjetive about this. The media is telling about horrible things happened or made by America, and too many ones is forgeting ther others don't deserve higher trust. <br /> <br /> Sorry, I have to go away, bye. <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Our allies don't trust us</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">. </span></span><span style=\"color:#6A6A6A\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Our enemies don't fear us&quot;. </b></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T03:30:16-07:00","id":988765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988734#post988734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, I didn't mean everybody from beyond wall of North Westeros are &quot;white walkers&quot;, but although we have to help and be supportive with all those innocent people who are running away from a zombie apocalipse, we must take care because among newcomers there are &quot;infected&quot; and &quot;spies&quot; with bad intentions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Calling fanatics and radicals &quot;zombies&quot; doesn't help anything. The enemies are humans, with human motivations. Defeating them requires remembering that they're human and that they've been driven to fanaticism for reasons that we can understand. Keeping in mind that they're people is essential to any functional approach to stopping the violence in the long term.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And don't forget the democrate party wants to bring refugees from Syria (and then you will suffer the same fate than Europe). </div> </div> </div>Based on what exactly?<br /> <br /> You lamented all the lax screening in Europe. We don't have that problem. It takes 1-2 years on average for a refugee to be brought to the US once they get their application in, and there's another year of monitoring once they're in the country.<br /> <br /> Is it perfect? No. But nothing is. We couldn't even close our borders to stop terrorists because we've had attacks committed by people born here that were radicalized over the Internet.<br /> <br /> Is it good enough that we should be helping people and trusting the system rather than worrying about bad people sneaking through it? Yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Maybe I am ignorant of a lot of things about Norhtamerica... (I thought Alaska was all ice until the serie &quot;Doctor in Alaska&quot; was broadcaster here), but also from here I can see somethings unkonwn for you, and my opinion may enrich this debate </div> </div> </div>What exactly do you think you see that people here don't?<br /> <br /> That there's risk in accepting refugees? Nope. We see that. It's a huge part of the current political debate here.<br /> <br /> That we're losing the propaganda war? Which one? That's too vague to be useful.<br /> <br /> That our allies don't trust us? Well, most reports say that's because we're at risk of electing Trump.<br /> <br /> That our enemies don't fear us? Sure they do. They're just wise to something different: American can't control other countries with fear. Inspiring fear in other countries and peoples isn't what makes a country great.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T04:52:07-07:00","id":988788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988246#post988246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think its time America abaddons the presidental system.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200bAbaddon is a weak third party candidate, your only real choices are Grazz't and Asmodeus. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\