ans went after Chelsea Clinton, started a social media campaign to put her out of business unless she called her father a rapist and her mother a spousal abuser. They'd be disgusted, I'd be disgusted, it would be way out of line, and inexcusible, but mark my worda that pandoria's box has now been opened and don't whine when that day comes, because I'll feel bad for Chelesea, but I'll know who to blame when it happens (if it happens, I hope that republicans show some more restraint then democracts have shown).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-30T15:18:33-07:00","id":995822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=995811#post995811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Ivanka Trump would have a hard time selling herself to the Christian Republicans with her conversion to Judaism. They could probably see past her not seeing herself as a Republican though. And it would be the height of irony for a Jewish woman from New York to be the face of the Republican Party.<br /> <br /> The GOP has had a weirdly bad streak of candidates in the past few years, I figure it's due to things people have mentioned previously. McCain was probably the strongest,