ass=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=995820#post995820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How would Democracts feel if Republicans went after Chelsea Clinton, started a social media campaign to put her out of business unless she called her father a rapist and her mother a spousal abuser. They'd be disgusted, I'd be disgusted, it would be way out of line, and inexcusible, but mark my worda that pandoria's box has now been opened and don't whine when that day comes, because I'll feel bad for Chelesea, but I'll know who to blame when it happens (if it happens, I hope that republicans show some more restraint then democracts have shown).</div> </div> </div> </div>As I recall during Bill Clinton's election campaign they brought up how she was ugly. Specifically she was called, 'The White House Dog.' But hey she was only 12.<br /> <br /> Right now, they're just saying she's not really Bill Clinton's daughter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-30-2016, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-30T16:20:34-07:00","id":995855,"title":"","content":"The only group the Republicans are for is the rich, same as the democracts, but if you lets them play trans, racial minorities, ect... against joe blow cis white males, including the poor and the middle class members and vis versa, the rich, who can be any race, nationality, sexual orientation, will continue to run everything with no opposition of any note.<br /> <br /> As long as 99% are engaged in pissing contests over indentity politics, the 1% will continue to laugh at us all. <br /> <br /> Most white cis males are just normal people worried about the future, worried about their families, ect..., they're not the enemy, they're just people, with there own problems and pain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-30T16:25:18-07:00","id":995856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=995853#post995853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As I recall during Bill Clinton's election campaign they brought up how she was ugly.<br /> <br /> Right now, they're just saying she's not really Bill Clinton's daughter.</div> </div> </div> </div> That disgusting, rude, and ignorant. But they're not trying to Bankurpt her and destroy her, like they are to Ivanka. Its a whole other scale.<br /> <br /> But if they continue I think some republicans will do more then just insult Chelsea, this door should never have been opened, the people behind Ivanka's boycott didn't think about the consquences of their actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-30T16:37:52-07:00","id":995862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=995856#post995856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But they're not trying to Bankurpt her and destroy her, like they are to Ivanka. Its a whole other scale.<br /> <br /> But if they continue I think some republicans will do more then just insult Chelsea, this door should never have been opened, the people behind Ivanka's boycott didn't think about the consquences of their actions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Shannon Coulter, the woman who started it? Or do you think it's a Democratic Party scheme? Because so far this is just the kind of response that happens when a business owner announces a statement that most of their customers don't agree with. Just as it's fair of the Republican party to cater to who they want to cater to, it's fair for customers to boycott a business whose owner they disagree with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user