tainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/987143-i-am-done-with-every-us-politician-i-am-voting-elmo-for-potus?p=988245#post988245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Well I sold my soul and endorsed Hillary (Asmodeous).<br /> <br /> But thankfully I'm Canada and ultimately I don't have to make this choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bYeah, until President Trump decides to invade you to get your oil. (I'm being sarcastic -- I fervently <i>hope</i>).<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never thought, in a million years I'd feel empathize, politically with Glenn Beck.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bUgh! Yes. This is like some weirdly f***ed up episode of The Twilight Zone.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a Statistician, I feel I must inform you that the odds of Trump winning are currently estimated at 9% by <a href=\"http://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2...-forecast.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2...-forecast.html</a>, which sounds small until you remember it's darned close to one in ten. So in one of eleven possible futures, President Trump is elected next Tuesday.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b*Insert random reference to Quan